OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of showers and brief
OL,6,Fbrighter spells. Best of the sheltered
OL,7,Fexpected towards Inverness. Shower
OL,8,Fbuilding from the west into the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with some turning heavier
OL,10,Fand bringing the risk of
OL,11,Fthunderstorms. Brisk southwest winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers occasional early
OL,14,Fevening, becoming confined to northern
OL,15,Fand western districts late evening.
OL,16,FCloud increasing overnight with patchy
OL,17,Frain developing by dawn. Southerly
OL,18,Fwinds strengthening with Hebridean
OL,19,Fgales developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
