OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FGales developing, perhaps
OL,6,Ftouching storm force over the Outer
OL,7,FHebrides. Rather cloudy with patchy
OL,8,Frain for much of the day, which turns
OL,9,Fmore persistent and heavier from late
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FShowery. Some heavier outbreaks
OL,14,Fappearing through to early Friday,
OL,15,Fthen turning less frequent and lighter
OL,16,Ffrom late Friday. Winds veering
OL,17,Fnorthwest on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
